## Camera profiles we deliberately do not ship

Some Fujifilm camera-profile LUTs found online (the `abpy` profiles, and
Fujifilm's own `.cube` files) have no license that permits redistribution, or
expect F-Log2/BT.2020 log input. They are not included here.

