## Audio

`shutter.wav` is synthesised from scratch by `packaging/make_package.py`
(two decaying sine pulses plus noise). No third-party sample is used.

## Screenshots

Every screenshot in `screenshots/` was rendered by `tools/mockshots.py` from
procedurally generated scenes (`tools/gen_scenes.py`). No photograph of a real
person or place is used.


## Acceleration

`filmbox.py` can render film copies on the GPU (EGL surfaceless + GLES2, tiled
to the driver's maximum texture size) or across CPU cores with `fork`. Both are
optional and chosen at runtime (`FILMBOX_ACCEL=auto|gpu|multi|cpu`); any failure
falls back to the single-threaded path in the same file.
